-- Seed data for mobile_legends_heroes (133 heroes, regenerated from the live API on 2026-09-20).
-- Paste into phpMyAdmin -> gabcas7_gelodb -> SQL tab -> Go.
--
-- Columns match the live table exactly; hero_id is left out so AUTO_INCREMENT assigns it.
-- Multiple roles / lanes are separated by "/" (the API splits them for the app).
-- difficulty is exactly one of: Easy | Medium | Hard.
-- picture is the hero's portrait on the Mobile Legends fandom wiki CDN (HeroNNN-portrait.png,
-- 240x390), resolved through the wiki's MediaWiki API on 2026-09-20. It must stay a full
-- https:// link to an image, never a binary; '' means no link (the app shows a monogram tile).
--
-- Safe to re-run only on an empty table: it does not check for existing names.

